{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a vibrant pixel-art world where strategy and creativity collide! In this city-building deck-building game, every card is a piece of your puzzle. Place buildings on a dynamic hexagonal grid, optimize your resource generation, and manage prices to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hexagonal City-Building:</strong> Place cards strategically to create a thriving city, balancing resources like Wheat, Meat, Metal, and Products. <strong>And u</strong>pgrade your city with houses, shops, and factories to boost resource production and create powerful combos.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/01263-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1751540565\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deck-Building Progression:</strong> Buy cards from a shop or select random rewards after each level to customize your deck and refine your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751540565\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buy Relics for Global Upgrades:</strong> Unlock powerful global upgrades that enhance your abilities and provide game-changing effects.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/01264-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1751540565\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the balance between resource generation, economic growth, and powerful upgrades to expand your city and unlock new challenges. Will you build the ultimate city?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424190?t=1751540565","background_raw":"